WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:02.560
Good morning.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.690
Hey, you're cute! Interested in a new club?

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.780
If you join now, you get the perk
of getting all heh-heh-heh

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.200
with Eruna Ichinomiya—me.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.320
Um...

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.240
No, thank you.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.040
It's a really fun club!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.000
Join up, and you can leave your honest life behind.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.460
Why won't anyone join?!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.170
You won't get anyone with a pitch like that, ryui.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.430
Good morning, pansies.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.260
Oh. Have you come by to play, butterfly?

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.680
Otone!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:45.310
Eruna the honeybee is here
to sting Otone's pure heart!

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.610
Hey listen, I have a club
recommendation for you!

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:48.940
Would you like to jo—

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.360
Get away!

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:57.530
I refuse. I'd sooner join a club
where they pop bubble wrap

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.790
for 24 hours straight than join your club.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.830
She really doesn't like you, ryui.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.500
Nice! Black Otone is in rare form again today!

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:07.710
Huh?

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:12.670
The treasure hunt is coming soon...?

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.890
That's it!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.370
Yay! Eruna the hero obtained an emerald brush!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:12.040
Yahoo! Eruna the hero obtained mystic lipstick!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.090
If I put this on, I'll go up by 2000 levels!

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.840
Stare...

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.400
And here I thought mice had
been going through the trash...

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.650
What are you doing?

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.280
Training for tomorrow's treasure hunt.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.950
Ah yes, the annual
orienteering event for new students.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.660
I've played a lot of these sorts of games,

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.250
so frankly, I think I stand a good chance!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.290
If I can attract some attention with this...

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.330
Let me join your club, Miss Eruna!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.210
I was here first!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.090
And I can get treasure, to boot!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.590
A ticket for a bath

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.180
where you and I wash
each other's backs would be nice!

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.680
Or one for where we eat sweets, like this.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.890
Or one for where we play, like this!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.520
Or one that lets me have
my way with you for a day.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.020
A shoulder massage.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.730
I might consider...
a ticket for a shoulder massage.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.150
R-R-Really?!

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:24.990
You can bet I'll finish first tomorrow,
and get that treasure!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.200
Then I'll thump your shoulders, rub them,

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.870
and maybe rub some places <i>besides</i>
your shoulders while I'm at it—

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.290
A <i>shoulder</i> massage ticket!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.130
Yes, ma'am! I'll do my best!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:44.430
First-year students,
welcome to the treasure hunt!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:49.770
Can't anyone in this school
besides Shigure emcee?

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.480
We can't help it if Shigure is hugely popular

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.270
with both boys and girls, ryui.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.690
When the newspaper club ranked
upperclassmen by their reliability,

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.070
he won first place by a landslide, ryui.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:01.740
All right, first I'll announce
our thrilling pairings of fate!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:02.570
Pairings?

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.910
You didn't know?

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.530
In the treasure hunt, you go around
to checkpoints in teams of two.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.580
Now, take a look at your devices!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:19.460
I'm Haruka Toishi, from the broadcast club.
I hope we do well.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.420
I'm with the drama club. My name is—

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.050
Wh-Wh-Why...?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.600
Usamaru! I hope we do well.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:32.730
Wha...?!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.230
Sorry about what happened, Usamaru.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.270
I tend to suddenly become a different person

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:40.110
when I'm holding a
musical instrument in a club battle.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.150
But today, let's work hard together.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.200
Come on, Usamaru!

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.660
Let's see, I'm paired up with...

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.450
...Otone!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.960
Otone!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.790
Wh-What is it?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.130
Looks like we're a team!

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:01.340
Hope we do well!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.880
Please stop that.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.260
The rules say you can only shake
Fujishiro's hand for one second,

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.050
and only if you buy ten of Fujishiro's CDs.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.770
I'll buy some! I will!
I'll even buy a hundred or a thousand!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.390
Now that everyone is paired off,

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.810
does the treasure contain
dreams, hopes, or worldly goods?

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.400
Seek, and you shall find!

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:27.950
U-Um... Do you suppose this means we can start?

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:32.580
Not to mention, his lips
are bleeding from rose thorns...

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.710
This is painful to watch. Let's go.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.750
Wee-oo wee-oo! Here comes first-aid Himi!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:47.090
I came right away when I heard
someone's heart was hurting.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.590
Pain, pain, go away!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:53.310
There you go. Are there anymore patients?

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.140
Ow! Ow-ow-ow! I think it's broken.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.480
My heart may have snapped right in two.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.940
Help me, Himi!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.940
Okay, Eruna. I have a shot for you!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.190
That won't heal a wounded heart!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.860
Then maybe you'll be okay if
I give you <i>two</i> shots?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.860
No, no. All I need is a little hug from you!

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.030
Squeeze me against those superb breasts

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.830
that don't match up with that tiny body!

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:17.120
Fine by me, but everybody's already started.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.710
Otone!

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.420
Good luck!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.680
I wonder if this is the right way.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:32.800
What do you think?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.220
Fujishiro isn't going to work with you at all.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:38.940
I'm only in this because I have to be
for my student record.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.190
I'm happy we get to be a team!
I was hoping to talk more with you!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:48.360
F-Fujishiro has no interest in the likes of you!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.780
Then I'll introduce myself,
so as to get you interested!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:54.160
I'm Eruna Ichinomiya,
born in New York and raised in London!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.490
I weigh the same as seven Tsugaru apples.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.660
Right now I'm living with Seisa
of the going-home club!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:05.420
Seisa? Oh, you mean the one
who can reshape space at will?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:06.630
Say what?

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.800
Fujishiro saw her do it.
It was raining heavily one night,

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:14.430
and when she said "Killing Art,"
the sky instantly filled with stars.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:15.640
You mean...

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.810
Wow, Seisa did that for us...

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.780
Th-That might be a wild monster.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:34.530
Right, I'll catch it and cook it up!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.120
Surely you jest!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.620
Bimii...? No, you're not.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:48.420
I am Mecha Bimii. I was sent
to liven up the treasure hunt.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.930
Come, I will guide you to the checkpoint.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.890
Looks like you're more reliable than Bimii!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.640
Hi, Ichinomiya.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.980
Welcome to the first checkpoint.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.480
A mental challenge, all of a sudden...?

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.900
If you can't pass it, you're out.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.280
Don't look at Fujishiro.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.370
All right. Super Miracle Man Quiz, begin!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.200
Question 1.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:21.080
When Super Miracle Man transforms,
what does he always eat?

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.210
Candy sticks!

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.920
Correct! Question 2!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.750
What enemy did Super Miracle Man fight
at Mount Fuji's Sea of Trees?

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.420
See-Through the 38th!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.840
Correct!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.090
The Charisma Colonizers!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.470
Correct!

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.300
Because he showed Masami
the diary Okada traded to him!

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.350
Correct!

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.850
100%! Way to go, Ichinomiya!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:41.930
Yay!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.310
What a brilliant mind!

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:49.980
The second checkpoint is a test
of strength against me, rowr!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:53.030
Let's get this fight started, rowr!

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.740
Ready, go.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.030
Why?!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:02.580
The third checkpoint is a vision test.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.370
Which way's this?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.830
Jiggle, up and down.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.040
What about this?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:07.710
Left.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:08.500
And this?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:08.960
Right!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:09.460
This?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:09.880
Up!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:10.300
This?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:10.710
Down!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:11.090
This?

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:11.460
Right!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:11.880
This?

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:12.210
Left!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:12.630
How about this?

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:13.380
Left again!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:13.970
This?

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:14.840
Left!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.300
Up! Down! Up! Up! Right! Left!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.350
100% correct!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.470
Nice motion vision!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.600
I want something to drink, too.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:28.810
Huh?

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:33.280
I have hot tea right here.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.740
Milk, straight from the cow this morning.

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:37.950
Hey you, the lanky one. Have some.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.450
How about you?

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.740
Oh, Eruna. Good luck.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.580
The treasure chest at the goal
isn't far from here.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.960
Keep at it!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:50.000
Once you reach it, let's all have another party.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.170
Just keep marching forward, rowr!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:57.130
Roger! I, Eruna Ichinomiya,
will find that treasure no matter what!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.590
That's the spirit!

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.730
Wait up, Otone!

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.020
Please don't follow me!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.230
Fujishiro has had enough and is retiring!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.570
Otone!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.780
Anticomplex!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.070
Snake!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:24.950
Owww...

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:31.210
Snake! Snake!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.710
Otone!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:40.010
I'm sick of watching you
and your friends act all chummy.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:46.140
My neck! My neck!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.860
I wonder where Otone went.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.830
Up ahead is out of bounds
for the treasure hunt, mecha.

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:08.330
Hold on, just a little further in.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.000
Mecha!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:27.180
Which pair will manage to obtain
this most wonderful treasure?

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.930
Huh? Has Ichinomiya stopped moving?

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.890
I wonder what's happened.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.650
Ouch...

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:39.860
Are you okay, mecha?

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.280
Yeah, I just got a little scraped up.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:46.830
I actually have a hunch
you're in worse shape, Mecha Bimii.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.000
I am, mecha?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:53.170
Yeah. This goes beyond the level of ugly.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.040
Truly, you flatter me, mecha.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.050
What do we do now, though?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.300
I can't fly all the way up there, mecha.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.050
And I lost my device, too.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.220
Guess all we can do is wait here
for help to arrive.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.900
You seem down, mecha.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.950
Right, then. If I keep digging,

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:27.580
I bet we'll come out somewhere
near Buenos Aires, mecha!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.750
It's not like I can rely on Mecha Bimii.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:35.250
If only some pretty girl would show up
to pull off a dashing rescue...

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.630
Could it really be?!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.670
Otone!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:43.760
How come you're here?

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.090
Oww...

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.300
Fujishiro likes to go for walks in this area.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:50.260
But what are <i>you</i> doing in such a place?

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.680
I got careless and slipped down from up there.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:56.350
I hurt my leg, too. What a screw-up, huh?

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.320
Otone...?

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:06.820
Come with me, please.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:32.640
This house is adorable!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.140
It's right out of a fairy tale!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.480
This is where Fujishiro comes to cry all alo—

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:41.110
I mean, where I come to plan my world conquest.

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:44.530
Aha! Nobody noticed you
were around until the rookie battle

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:46.860
because this is where you were.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:51.160
It's a secret! If news of this got out,
it would show up on my record!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.040
I am Mecha Bimii, mecha.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.750
That wouldn't matter
even if this were the real Bimii.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.120
Oh, that's right.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:01.960
Hot!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.920
Wow! That's great!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.840
I never dreamed there was a
pretty girl in the 21st century

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.760
who'd say "Hot!" and put her hand to her ear!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:10.970
What a discovery!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.100
Wh-What's gotten into <i>you</i>?

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:16.980
Maybe letting her in here was a mistake!

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.860
Anyhow, I'm making tea.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:24.860
Oh, and you can drink from the faucet outside.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:25.780
Mecha!

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:27.360
This is how you treat me once you know

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.200
it won't affect your record, mecha?!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.910
This is a one-person place,
but there are two of everything.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.540
The cups, chairs, and coasters...

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.380
Even the homemade sweets.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:43.880
Th-That's not true!

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:46.300
It's not like I've been
spending teatime by myself,

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.470
all the while thinking how nice it'd be

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.220
if someone else was sitting across from me!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.260
Otone.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.350
I'll help out!

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.430
N-No thank you.

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.270
Let me help. Maybe I'll get the fish ready.

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.730
Please don't serve fish at teatime!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.150
Then I'll knead the udon dough.

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:05.270
Look, this is <i>teatime</i>!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.530
And it's not like I want
to have teatime with you, anyway!

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:10.280
Come on, just play along.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.250
Well, Otone, let's drink.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.380
Help yourself.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.640
You put jam in it?! Isn't that weird?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.100
Are you confusing that with miso?

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:38.100
I think putting miso in would be a lot weirder!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.320
That's good!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.820
It has a mild taste and a full-bodied flavor.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.910
It's better than any miso soup I've ever had!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.950
Look, it's not miso soup! It's Russian tea!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.950
Wow, there're even russet apples in here?!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.830
You owe the Russians an apology!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.080
You deserve to spend the rest of your life

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.500
doing a barefoot Cossack dance
in the frozen wilds of Siberia!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.090
It really is good!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.550
You're unbelievable...

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:25.770
M-Maybe Fujishiro will try adding a little more.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.940
I'll put some more in mine, too!

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.660
- Sweet!
- Sweet!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.160
Hey.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.500
Let's give the treasure hunt another try.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.500
I want to find the treasure with you!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.800
It-It isn't that simple...

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.670
Mecha!

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.070
Why?!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.480
Eruna!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.110
Killing Art!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.780
Anticomplex!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:57.990
Bridge!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.290
Hurry across!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.060
Tension max!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:24.930
Go!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.780
Right on!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.650
We did it!

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:40.070
Let's go, Otone!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.280
Sure!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.830
Oh, Eruna's come back!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.960
The final pair has returned at last.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.050
Welcome back, Eruna!

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:57.460
Good work, Ichinomiya.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:58.800
- Good work, rowr!
- Good work.
- Good work.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.760
It took you long enough, ryui.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.010
It's real Bimii!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.140
Real huggy, real crummy, real Bimii!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:07.140
Don't go slipping insults
into your jabber, ryui!

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.180
Ow!

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.560
So, which pair won?

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.480
One you would never suspect.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:15.020
Usamaru?!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.650
By the way, the treasure chest contains...

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:21.160
...a ticket good for a manga
based on the two of you, drawn by me!

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.950
I'd like an eloquent story
about passionate youth!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.910
It'll just turn out to be psychological horror!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.210
You did well too, Fujishiro.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.880
Otone helped me out a ton!

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.680
I've heard about you from the flowers.

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:44.760
Thank you for always taking care of them.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.060
Oh, so you like flowers.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.640
Uh, no...

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:50.980
Um...

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:55.150
I-It's time for Fujishiro to go
hang out with the hooligans in town,

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.270
and cause trouble!

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:08.370
Why does Fujishiro have such trouble opening up?

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.330
Otone.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.040
Y-You again?

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.130
I didn't get a chance to thank you properly.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.090
I can do without thanks.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:21.630
Thank you. Doing the treasure hunt
with you was fun.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.390
Not that we actually managed
to hunt down any treasure.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:25.590
I did.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:29.220
I found a treasure.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.650
Otone, how about we form a new club?

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.320
I'm still not even sure about the concept,

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:43.450
but I bet you and I can
put together an awesome club!

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:51.500
If you insist.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.960
There's... no reason for me not to join.

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:45.110
We're finally friends!
Let's form a new club, Otone!

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:47.360
Hey, could you maybe not flatter yourself

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:50.070
just because you drank
Russian tea with Fujishiro?

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:53.200
There she is! Black Otone! That's great!

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:55.490
Now try being Red Otone!

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:59.500
There is no such Fujishiro!

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:01.540
Oh, that's kinda hot-blooded!

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:02.840
Okay, next do Yellow!

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:04.630
Curry is so delicious.

00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:05.840
You're really playing along?!

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:08.050
Now for the big one: Pink!

00:24:08.260 --> 00:24:09.930
Could you maybe not get carried away?

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:11.050
You're back to Black!

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:15.560
Enough of the idle chatter, you two.
Just do the preview already, mecha.

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:18.430
Mecha Bimii! You survived!

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.770
Next time, "Derailed Scandal."

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:25.570
Bimii's terrible, sad secret
finally comes to light, mecha.
